<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pork loins weak; butts mostly $3.00 lower; skinned hams and seedless bellies steady; trimmings steady to weak.</p>
